OL,3,GNEWSAWork to start on city's delayed
OL,4,Auniversity campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a delayed university campus is
OL,7,Fset to start in the new year.
OL,9,FThe University of Cumbria has confirmed
OL,10,Fbuilding work for its new Carlisle
OL,11,FCitadels development will begin in
OL,12,Fearly 2027.
OL,14,FIt is part of a #85.2m project, which
OL,15,Fpreviously saw the opening of a new
OL,16,Fcampus in Barrow and of the Pears
OL,17,FCumbria School of Medicine in Carlisle.
OL,19,FSubject to the necessary permissions,
OL,20,Fthe city centre campus is expected to
OL,21,Fopen in 2029 - three years later than
OL,22,Finitially expected.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
